WEBVTT

1
00:47:23.810 --> 00:47:27.050
We will give the word to them for a moment.

2
00:47:29.570 --> 00:47:33.610
How wonderful! So many beautiful people.

3
00:47:33.650 --> 00:47:35.810
Please make yourselves comfortable!

4
00:47:35.850 --> 00:47:39.130
Kim always says that too, right? Please make yourselves comfortable.

5
00:47:39.170 --> 00:47:43.010
You know, I found it so special, that song we just sang.

6
00:47:43.050 --> 00:47:48.690
Because I was of course also praying for the talk I was going to give here.

7
00:47:48.690 --> 00:47:55.490
And the Lord showed me, Matthew 7, verse 24.

8
00:47:55.530 --> 00:48:00.410
Everyone who hears my words and puts them into practice,

9
00:48:00.450 --> 00:48:06.930
will be like a wise man who built his house on a rock.

10
00:48:06.970 --> 00:48:10.170
Well, that's what it's all about.

11
00:48:10.210 --> 00:48:16.730
And I want to draw the house here, not to our personal lives,

12
00:48:16.810 --> 00:48:19.490
but to the church for a moment.

13
00:48:20.650 --> 00:48:26.330
The house we are building is the house, the church.

14
00:48:26.370 --> 00:48:29.290
40 years ago.

15
00:48:29.330 --> 00:48:38.170
And when Kees and I came to repentance in 1974 through the birth of our Debbie,

16
00:48:38.210 --> 00:48:45.090
well, she is still here, she was already a little organizer in the crib as a small baby,

17
00:48:45.090 --> 00:48:48.970
because she was so beautiful, I thought it was so wonderful.

18
00:48:49.010 --> 00:48:53.570
And at that moment, I just knew that God exists.

19
00:48:53.610 --> 00:49:01.930
You know, the Bible says so beautifully that we can understand with our minds that God exists.

20
00:49:01.970 --> 00:49:08.690
We only need to look at nature or at your own newborn child.

21
00:49:08.810 --> 00:49:15.050
During the gatherings in the church where we were, that was in Zwijndrecht,

22
00:49:15.090 --> 00:49:20.730
we lived there at the time, we had a very nice church, but the Word of God kept coming.

23
00:49:20.770 --> 00:49:26.650
In the past, it was very much in, shall I say, that you had a lot of pastors.

24
00:49:26.690 --> 00:49:29.490
So those pastors would rotate like that.

25
00:49:29.530 --> 00:49:34.770
Lately, that has been a bit less, because you tend to stick with your own pastor.

26
00:49:34.810 --> 00:49:41.130
Actually, that is the case all over the Netherlands, but back then it was really a trend to have many pastors.

27
00:49:41.170 --> 00:49:46.730
And then Kees and I were always picked out from the audience, even though we didn't know those people at all.

28
00:49:46.770 --> 00:49:50.570
And they would say, you are not going to stay there, you are going away.

29
00:49:50.610 --> 00:49:56.290
Well, we thought, yes, we are going into missions, so that will be Africa or Japan, you know,

30
00:49:56.330 --> 00:50:03.210
also such a country that hardly knows Christ. So we waited for that.

31
00:50:03.290 --> 00:50:10.570
And then suddenly there came a word from our pastor's wife, who said...

32
00:50:10.610 --> 00:50:19.210
I see Kees and Agnes going to a strange field and all those people I see there, I do not know at all.

33
00:50:19.250 --> 00:50:29.530
I see Agnes and Kees plowing, sowing, weeding, and immediately harvesting.

34
00:50:29.530 --> 00:50:38.890
Well, she says, that cannot be, because seasons go by, you sow and after a while you get the harvest.

35
00:50:38.930 --> 00:50:46.530
No, said the Lord, it will not go that way for Kees and Agnes, it will happen all at once in one day, and all at the same time.

36
00:50:46.570 --> 00:50:50.610
Well, we have noticed that, it really happened that way.

37
00:50:50.610 --> 00:51:01.210
The verse that I have always held on to in my life is the verse from Proverbs 3, verses 5 to 6.

38
00:51:01.250 --> 00:51:08.290
Trust in the Lord with all your heart and do not lean on your own understanding.

39
00:51:08.330 --> 00:51:13.250
Acknowledge Him in all your ways, and He will make your paths straight.

40
00:51:13.250 --> 00:51:21.650
And I have always done that, always praying and obeying the Word of God.

41
00:51:21.690 --> 00:51:27.530
Obeying the Word of God, say Lord what is your will for this or that situation.

42
00:51:27.570 --> 00:51:31.810
You know, the Lord always spoke and always.

43
00:51:31.850 --> 00:51:42.970
At a certain moment the time was ripe, through Kees' work the Lord brought us in a wonderful way to Eersel.

44
00:51:42.970 --> 00:51:46.890
Well, we didn't know Eersel at all, had to really look it up on the map.

45
00:51:46.930 --> 00:51:51.210
But I really had the feeling that, well, at Reuzel, you fall off the world.

46
00:51:51.250 --> 00:51:56.210
Especially if you come from such a busy metropolitan area.

47
00:51:56.250 --> 00:52:01.330
But I loved it, the peace, the forests, wonderful.

48
00:52:01.370 --> 00:52:08.330
And Kees got a beautiful job in Eersel and could take good care of his family.

49
00:52:08.370 --> 00:52:16.170
And from the very first moment, dear people, that we lived there, the Lord began to lead us in a wonderful way.

50
00:52:16.210 --> 00:52:19.170
For we asked, yes Lord, how should we begin?

51
00:52:19.210 --> 00:52:22.810
We knew that a work would arise, but what and how?

52
00:52:22.850 --> 00:52:24.970
Yes, that is then difficult.

53
00:52:25.010 --> 00:52:30.730
Well, we prayed a lot, so we went on many prayer walks.

54
00:52:30.770 --> 00:52:37.010
But also by car we went out and then we said to the little ones, we are going to look at rabbits.

55
00:52:37.010 --> 00:52:39.490
That was usually in the evening hours.

56
00:52:39.530 --> 00:52:44.370
And while we were going to look at rabbits, we prayed everywhere.

57
00:52:44.410 --> 00:52:48.610
And there were moments when we were praying, that it was very quiet outside...

58
00:52:48.650 --> 00:52:52.010
and suddenly all the cats and dogs started to meow.

59
00:52:52.050 --> 00:52:54.770
You probably still remember that.

60
00:52:54.810 --> 00:52:59.770
And there were such special things during those prayers.

61
00:52:59.810 --> 00:53:02.810
The children naturally found that wonderful, such things.

62
00:53:02.850 --> 00:53:08.410
At a certain moment, the Lord made it very clear to me that we needed to start with children's work.

63
00:53:08.450 --> 00:53:11.010
Through the children, you will reach the parents.

64
00:53:11.050 --> 00:53:12.570
Well, we did that.

65
00:53:12.610 --> 00:53:19.290
And the anointing of the Lord was so great that even the principal of the elementary school made sure...

66
00:53:19.330 --> 00:53:23.530
that flyers were distributed in all the schools in the Kempen...

67
00:53:23.570 --> 00:53:29.770
with the invitation to the start of the children's Bible club, the holiday children's Bible club.

68
00:53:29.770 --> 00:53:32.810
Well, that's what I did. So I started a children's Bible club.

69
00:53:32.850 --> 00:53:36.570
And there the little ones began to come to repentance.

70
00:53:36.610 --> 00:53:39.410
Narnie was the first.

71
00:53:39.450 --> 00:53:42.730
A great miracle happened with Narnie.

72
00:53:42.770 --> 00:53:45.170
You should go ask her what that was.

73
00:53:45.210 --> 00:53:47.090
She will tell you.

74
00:53:47.130 --> 00:53:49.450
Roland, still.

75
00:53:49.490 --> 00:53:52.490
Well, Roland, I see you, I did mention you.

76
00:53:52.530 --> 00:53:56.930
And then Jo van de Vondervoort, she is now with the Lord.

77
00:53:56.970 --> 00:53:58.770
Her daughter is here.

78
00:53:58.810 --> 00:54:01.810
She came to repentance in a spectacular way.

79
00:54:01.850 --> 00:54:04.090
Unbelievable, also a whole story.

80
00:54:04.130 --> 00:54:06.410
We are not going to do that.

81
00:54:06.450 --> 00:54:08.850
Really very special.

82
00:54:08.890 --> 00:54:11.490
The journey has been beautiful, dear people.

83
00:54:11.530 --> 00:54:13.290
The journey was fantastic.

84
00:54:13.330 --> 00:54:15.810
This house is built on the rock.

85
00:54:15.850 --> 00:54:20.450
And even with many storms, this house has remained standing.

86
00:54:20.490 --> 00:54:23.730
There were rain showers, so nothing.

87
00:54:23.770 --> 00:54:28.650
But sometimes it has pounded and thundered.

88
00:54:28.810 --> 00:54:30.930
And shaken.

89
00:54:30.970 --> 00:54:33.210
It was really sometimes not normal.

90
00:54:33.250 --> 00:54:36.090
But it just kept standing.

91
00:54:36.130 --> 00:54:39.610
The congregation has just kept standing.

92
00:54:39.650 --> 00:54:42.610
So fantastic.

93
00:54:42.650 --> 00:54:46.330
And now we see, the faithful have remained.

94
00:54:46.370 --> 00:54:51.250
But also a whole lot of beautiful, young, new people have joined.

95
00:54:51.290 --> 00:54:53.890
I think it's so wonderful.

96
00:54:54.050 --> 00:54:59.730
Who are building together on that beautiful congregation, on that house on the rock.

97
00:54:59.770 --> 00:55:04.090
And when I was pregnant, dear people, that's nice.

98
00:55:04.130 --> 00:55:11.730
From our fifth child, there came a word from the Lord from a very unexpected corner.

99
00:55:11.770 --> 00:55:14.490
It was a kind of vision.

100
00:55:14.530 --> 00:55:16.810
And the vision said...

101
00:55:16.850 --> 00:55:20.090
There is a large tree in bloom.

102
00:55:20.130 --> 00:55:23.170
And they are all pink blossoms.

103
00:55:23.210 --> 00:55:30.010
But suddenly a branch shoots out from that tree and it is a blue blossom.

104
00:55:30.050 --> 00:55:38.130
The branches with pink blossoms move a little aside to allow the blue branch to develop.

105
00:55:38.170 --> 00:55:44.410
And then came the word that this child will follow your ministry.

106
00:55:44.450 --> 00:55:49.930
And when the time was ripe, the congregation stood massively behind...

107
00:55:49.930 --> 00:55:54.970
... and Tim was sent out to do his theological studies in Sydney.

108
00:55:55.010 --> 00:56:00.330
And together we provided for his college and living expenses.

109
00:56:00.370 --> 00:56:11.570
Tim returned with his beautiful bride, Vanessa, who is not my daughter-in-law, but she is my daughter.

110
00:56:11.610 --> 00:56:15.130
She has truly become my daughter.

111
00:56:15.170 --> 00:56:19.490
We have a very beautiful bond and that is only nice.

112
00:56:19.490 --> 00:56:25.330
This is how it happened and we are very grateful for what the Lord has done in our 34 years...

113
00:56:25.370 --> 00:56:29.730
and six beautiful years of Tim and Vanessa.

114
00:56:29.770 --> 00:56:37.890
That we can now wonderfully enjoy our retirement and see how everything is going well is delightful for us.

115
00:56:37.930 --> 00:56:45.570
What can you wish for as the founder of a congregation better than to have such a beautiful succession?

116
00:56:45.610 --> 00:56:48.770
What God Himself has provided.

117
00:56:48.810 --> 00:56:56.050
I am definitely going to write a book, 100 percent sure, about what has all happened here.

118
00:56:56.090 --> 00:57:02.490
The concept is already there and I also have the title, The Wonders in the Kempen.

119
00:57:02.530 --> 00:57:07.490
With 50 years of existence, the book will be published, 100 percent sure.

120
00:57:07.530 --> 00:57:10.410
Finally, I want to add.

121
00:57:10.450 --> 00:57:17.490
The Lord once spoke very clearly to me, with an almost audible voice.

122
00:57:17.490 --> 00:57:23.330
He was very serious. He said that this congregation is my pride and joy,

123
00:57:23.370 --> 00:57:29.810
because this congregation is built on my Word and not through division,

124
00:57:29.850 --> 00:57:35.490
but is built from the beginning on me, the rock. Amen.

125
00:57:35.530 --> 00:57:37.530
APPLAUSE.

126
00:57:37.530 --> 00:57:38.530
MUSIC.

127
00:57:47.210 --> 00:57:50.210
Hallelujah.

128
00:57:50.250 --> 00:57:57.210
It feels a bit unfamiliar for me after all this time, but rest assured, it will be alright.

129
00:57:57.250 --> 00:57:58.250
MUSIC.

130
00:57:59.250 --> 00:58:07.690
I have a few things to share and also some information about the path we have walked.

131
00:58:07.730 --> 00:58:11.130
This text is incredibly important.

132
00:58:11.170 --> 00:58:16.330
If the Lord does not build the house, Psalm 127, verse 1,

133
00:58:16.370 --> 00:58:23.530
then it is of no use for those builders to work hard.

134
00:58:23.530 --> 00:58:28.770
You can work as much as you want, but if God is not behind it, it is human work.

135
00:58:28.810 --> 00:58:32.170
That is what the Bible says.

136
00:58:32.210 --> 00:58:39.650
We must do it together, and as I see it, that is going very well.

137
00:58:39.690 --> 00:58:43.970
Just a look back at how things were.

138
00:58:44.010 --> 00:58:50.490
In Eerstel, when we started there, the gatherings were from hall to hall.

139
00:58:50.610 --> 00:58:54.690
That was due to the circumstances, and they worked out for the good.

140
00:58:54.730 --> 00:58:58.090
One time we were in the Brink in Eerstel, the next time in Hapert,

141
00:58:58.130 --> 00:59:01.010
another time in Reuzel, still in Reuzel,

142
00:59:01.050 --> 00:59:06.010
another time in Steentsel and Hapert and so on,

143
00:59:06.050 --> 00:59:08.490
and then again in Lommel.

144
00:59:08.530 --> 00:59:15.490
We traveled back and forth and Roland has shuffled some equipment in various cars and so on,

145
00:59:15.530 --> 00:59:20.250
to dress it up a bit.

146
00:59:20.370 --> 00:59:28.130
From hall to hall, we are actually a bit up against a limit.

147
00:59:28.170 --> 00:59:30.050
Something needs to happen.

148
00:59:30.090 --> 00:59:36.890
We can no longer rent and set everything up again and then break it down.

149
00:59:36.930 --> 00:59:42.490
People could no longer find us, because where is this Sunday’s new gathering?

150
00:59:42.530 --> 00:59:48.290
So we prayed for perhaps a place of our own, a building of our own.

151
00:59:48.370 --> 00:59:57.810
Here in Lommel, we have gathered a lot at the halls that are associated with a church.

152
00:59:57.850 --> 01:00:02.530
The sand and the bowl, yes, those kinds of things.

153
01:00:02.570 --> 01:00:07.650
But because of that, you are less easily found and it is a lot of work.

154
01:00:07.690 --> 01:00:10.290
And yet, Roland, again your name.

155
01:00:10.330 --> 01:00:13.450
You have never complained or been negative, but you have always been there,

156
01:00:13.490 --> 01:00:17.290
for God and for the congregation. Hallelujah!

157
01:00:17.330 --> 01:00:19.490
APPLAUSE

158
01:00:19.530 --> 01:00:22.210
And others of course too, right!

159
01:00:22.250 --> 01:00:30.410
Then suddenly on a Monday evening at five to twelve, at night, the phone rings and Agnes picks up.

160
01:00:30.450 --> 01:00:36.410
It is someone from the organization that used to be here in the church, in the little building.

161
01:00:36.450 --> 01:00:42.370
I see an advertisement from you, which I had placed on the website.

162
01:00:42.970 --> 01:00:49.250
Looking for a building shorter than 1 kilometer from the Netherlands-Belgium border.

163
01:00:49.290 --> 01:00:52.730
Several people said that's foolish, that's way too small.

164
01:00:52.770 --> 01:00:57.170
Do you know that this hall is 900 meters from the border?

165
01:00:57.210 --> 01:01:02.050
When God is at work, He winks along and laughs along. Hallelujah!

166
01:01:02.090 --> 01:01:07.570
Well, we bought this, first rented, then bought.

167
01:01:07.690 --> 01:01:09.690
And...

168
01:01:12.890 --> 01:01:14.890
It is paid off.

169
01:01:14.930 --> 01:01:16.930
It is paid off.

170
01:01:16.970 --> 01:01:18.970
And an additional hall.

171
01:01:19.010 --> 01:01:21.010
Yes, and an additional hall.

172
01:01:21.050 --> 01:01:25.170
I remember well, when Tim came back, we were actually ready to build this hall.

173
01:01:25.210 --> 01:01:28.570
A lot of work has been done by all the congregation members.

174
01:01:28.610 --> 01:01:34.370
And I won't mention any more names now, because, yes, I want everyone to have it,

175
01:01:34.410 --> 01:01:37.290
but it takes too long otherwise.

176
01:01:37.290 --> 01:01:44.170
But well, eh, drawings made, permits requested, to the bank and build.

177
01:01:44.210 --> 01:01:46.210
That's how it happened.

178
01:01:46.250 --> 01:01:50.890
Well, I could write a book about it, but I doubt whether I will.

179
01:01:50.930 --> 01:01:52.930
LAUGHTER

180
01:01:52.970 --> 01:01:55.530
But I would like to.

181
01:01:55.570 --> 01:01:59.250
And I can't help it, a teaching text.

182
01:01:59.250 --> 01:02:11.530
As Jezevier says, God has given to the congregation apostles, starters, prophets, the heart of God,

183
01:02:11.570 --> 01:02:19.890
uh, evangelists, evangelists, that's us too.

184
01:02:19.930 --> 01:02:26.450
And when you go to your neighbor for a cup of coffee and you talk about Jesus,

185
01:02:26.450 --> 01:02:30.250
then they are evangelists and shepherds and teachers.

186
01:02:30.290 --> 01:02:34.250
Once again, apostles, prophets, evangelists, shepherds, and teachers.

187
01:02:34.290 --> 01:02:39.650
There are five of them, so a handful, fivefold ministry.

188
01:02:39.690 --> 01:02:46.970
If a congregation does not have a fivefold ministry, then something is missing, at least something.

189
01:02:47.010 --> 01:02:52.330
But all these ministries are well present here in the congregation.

190
01:02:52.370 --> 01:02:57.130
You and Vanessa have everything neatly organized as well.

191
01:02:57.170 --> 01:03:02.730
And have a plan for the coming years on how that will continue. Wonderful!

192
01:03:02.770 --> 01:03:09.290
That is caring for each other. Together we will be able to do the work of God.

193
01:03:09.330 --> 01:03:12.370
Shall we stand and give him a round of applause?

194
01:03:12.410 --> 01:03:13.410
APPLAUSE.

195
01:03:23.330 --> 01:03:25.210
Thank you very much.

196
01:03:25.250 --> 01:03:29.930
And may I now invite our current pastor, Tim and Vanessa.

197
01:03:29.970 --> 01:03:31.530
CHEERING AND APPLAUSE.

198
01:03:31.570 --> 01:03:32.570
MUSIC.

199
01:03:52.330 --> 01:03:53.330
MUSIC.

200
01:04:22.450 --> 01:04:28.050
What has happened is truly miraculous!

201
01:04:36.090 --> 01:04:38.490
For we love each other!

202
01:04:42.650 --> 01:04:45.370
And they are 100% behind us.

203
01:04:46.370 --> 01:04:51.450
And that is such a blessing, not only for us, but for the whole house.

204
01:04:53.770 --> 01:04:55.370
Do we understand that?

205
01:04:56.610 --> 01:04:58.610
That doesn't happen all the time.

206
01:05:00.090 --> 01:05:02.490
But God is truly in the house.

207
01:05:04.530 --> 01:05:07.330
And I feel the weight of that.

208
01:05:08.290 --> 01:05:13.090
In April 2016, we were blessed here in the ministry.

209
01:05:17.170 --> 01:05:21.890
I was pregnant with Olivia, maybe you remember.

210
01:05:27.930 --> 01:05:32.010
And I still remember, when we knelt for that blessing...

211
01:05:37.370 --> 01:05:42.810
... and I remember saying it felt like our second wedding day.

212
01:05:50.090 --> 01:05:55.130
For at that moment, we made a vow to the Lord again.

213
01:06:00.090 --> 01:06:04.410
Together we make a vow to serve Him and His people.

214
01:06:07.450 --> 01:06:10.250
And there is a weight to that.

215
01:06:13.250 --> 01:06:19.050
And I remember it so well, it was truly a moment of making that promise.

216
01:06:27.290 --> 01:06:32.010
And I remember that I really felt that calling in my bones.

217
01:06:37.330 --> 01:06:43.690
I felt that change and I felt it was time for us to step into it...

218
01:06:43.690 --> 01:06:45.690
... and I felt that deep in my bones.

219
01:06:49.690 --> 01:06:53.690
And from that moment on, we have seen the Lord take the lead.

220
01:06:58.090 --> 01:07:00.090
We have followed His guidance.

221
01:07:00.130 --> 01:07:06.570
We have not made our own strategies and plans.

222
01:07:09.370 --> 01:07:16.090
But we have tried to zoom in on what the Lord was already doing and wanted to do.

223
01:07:21.690 --> 01:07:23.690
And He has led through His Spirit.

224
01:07:25.930 --> 01:07:29.170
What a day to celebrate the leadership of the Holy Spirit.

225
01:07:31.090 --> 01:07:34.090
For it is real, I feel His leadership.

226
01:07:37.090 --> 01:07:43.090
And in a short time, in a short seven years we have gone through various waters.

227
01:07:49.090 --> 01:07:51.090
We have seen an enormous transformation.

228
01:07:54.090 --> 01:07:56.090
In a way, a metamorphosis.

229
01:07:57.090 --> 01:07:59.090
I am so proud of the Amidden.

230
01:08:05.090 --> 01:08:07.090
It is truly beautiful how the Lord has led us.

231
01:08:11.090 --> 01:08:13.090
For it is about Him receiving His glory.

232
01:08:16.090 --> 01:08:18.090
And I am so proud of them.

233
01:08:27.090 --> 01:08:29.090
And as we continue.

