01:58:24.090 --> 01:58:28.090
And you don't need much talent to put something together from that.

727
01:58:29.090 --> 01:58:30.090
A little hut, or something like that.

728
01:58:31.090 --> 01:58:35.090
But if you want to build with gold and silver and precious stones,

729
01:58:36.090 --> 01:58:39.090
you will need to specialize in those techniques.

730
01:58:40.090 --> 01:58:41.090
You will have to go further.

731
01:58:42.090 --> 01:58:45.090
You will need to dig deep into the Bible,

732
01:58:46.090 --> 01:58:51.090
to bring forth those precious stones of wisdom and advice.

733
01:58:54.090 --> 01:58:55.090
What do you want in your life?

734
01:58:57.090 --> 01:58:59.090
Do you want to do it easily? That is possible.

735
01:59:00.090 --> 01:59:03.090
Or do you want to put in that extra effort, with a beautiful result?

736
01:59:05.090 --> 01:59:06.090
Verse 13 continues.

737
01:59:08.090 --> 01:59:10.090
Whether you have built well or poorly,

738
01:59:11.090 --> 01:59:13.090
will be evident on the last day.

739
01:59:14.090 --> 01:59:15.090
For that day comes with fire.

740
01:59:16.090 --> 01:59:19.090
And we have already said earlier at Pentecost, the Holy Spirit comes with fire.

741
01:59:20.090 --> 01:59:26.090
The Holy Spirit will reveal on that day what has taken place in your life.

742
01:59:27.090 --> 01:59:29.090
Fire purifies.

743
01:59:30.090 --> 01:59:32.090
If you have built a hut of wood and straw,

744
01:59:33.090 --> 01:59:34.090
it will be gone just like that.

745
01:59:34.090 --> 01:59:40.090
If you have built with gold, you will see that even the impurities dissolve.

746
01:59:41.090 --> 01:59:43.090
The Holy Spirit will do that.

747
01:59:46.090 --> 01:59:47.090
Verse 13.

748
01:59:48.090 --> 01:59:50.090
And the fire will make clear what has been built with.

749
01:59:51.090 --> 01:59:52.090
Verse 14.

750
01:59:53.090 --> 01:59:56.090
If the structure you have built on a foundation stands firm,

751
01:59:57.090 --> 01:59:59.090
you will receive a reward from the Lord.

752
01:59:59.090 --> 02:00:01.090
I indeed find that amazing.

753
02:00:02.090 --> 02:00:06.090
For I have also thought for a long time, you just go to heaven and that's it.

754
02:00:07.090 --> 02:00:08.090
All the same.

755
02:00:09.090 --> 02:00:10.090
Clearly, that is not the case.

756
02:00:12.090 --> 02:00:13.090
Verse 15.

757
02:00:14.090 --> 02:00:17.090
But if it burns down, you will not receive a reward.

758
02:00:18.090 --> 02:00:19.090
And I find that beautiful.

759
02:00:20.090 --> 02:00:22.090
You will be saved, but it will be as if you have gone through fire.

760
02:00:23.090 --> 02:00:25.090


761
02:00:25.090 --> 02:00:29.090
Vanessa spoke exactly about this a few weeks ago.

762
02:00:30.090 --> 02:00:34.090
And this is about salvation and sanctification.

763
02:00:35.090 --> 02:00:37.090
So laying the foundation,

764
02:00:38.090 --> 02:00:42.090
verse 15 says, you will be saved yourself.

765
02:00:43.090 --> 02:00:46.090
You are saved anyway, if you have the foundation of Jesus Christ.

766
02:00:47.090 --> 02:00:48.090
That is the basis.

767
02:00:49.090 --> 02:00:50.090
That is the foundation.

768
02:00:51.090 --> 02:00:52.090
But that reward,

769
02:00:52.090 --> 02:00:53.090
that is a step further.

770
02:00:54.090 --> 02:00:56.090
That awaits you in eternity.

771
02:01:01.090 --> 02:01:07.090
If you give your attention, your focus, and your dedication completely to God,

772
02:01:08.090 --> 02:01:11.090
that is building with gold, silver, and precious stones.

773
02:01:12.090 --> 02:01:13.090
That takes effort.

774
02:01:14.090 --> 02:01:15.090
That requires more attention.

775
02:01:16.090 --> 02:01:17.090
That is indeed what Tim said.

776
02:01:18.090 --> 02:01:19.090
I don't feel like going on Monday.

777
02:01:19.090 --> 02:01:20.090
I don't feel like going on Monday.

778
02:01:21.090 --> 02:01:22.090
I don't feel like praying now.

779
02:01:23.090 --> 02:01:24.090
Someone else will pray in my place.

780
02:01:25.090 --> 02:01:26.090
Yes, but that is actually laziness.

781
02:01:27.090 --> 02:01:28.090
That is building with straw.

782
02:01:29.090 --> 02:01:33.090
If you take a step further, then you get those precious stones.

783
02:01:36.090 --> 02:01:40.090
What I found to be a very beautiful quote from Vanessa, a few weeks ago, was this.

784
02:01:41.090 --> 02:01:45.090
Regarding building with wood or with precious stones.

785
02:01:46.090 --> 02:01:52.090
Your salvation determines the place where you spend your eternity.

786
02:01:54.090 --> 02:01:56.090
With the foundation of Jesus you are saved.

787
02:01:57.090 --> 02:02:00.090
That determines where you spend your eternity, with Him.

788
02:02:01.090 --> 02:02:05.090
But sanctification determines how you spend eternity.

789
02:02:07.090 --> 02:02:10.090
And I found it such a beautiful statement.

790
02:02:11.090 --> 02:02:13.090
I have a list with all kinds of quotes.

791
02:02:13.090 --> 02:02:16.090
Also quotes that we use in our family.

792
02:02:17.090 --> 02:02:20.090
And that I regularly go through to remind myself.

793
02:02:21.090 --> 02:02:23.090
Wow, let's pause for a moment here.

794
02:02:24.090 --> 02:02:27.090
Salvation determines the place where you spend eternity.

795
02:02:28.090 --> 02:02:31.090
And sanctification determines how you spend eternity.

796
02:02:33.090 --> 02:02:38.090
If the building that you have built on the foundation stands firm, you will receive a reward from the Lord.

797
02:02:39.090 --> 02:02:41.090
And then I come back to the church for a moment.

798
02:02:41.090 --> 02:02:45.090
The church is built, founded on Jesus Christ.

799
02:02:46.090 --> 02:02:48.090
And now the new construction phase begins.

800
02:02:49.090 --> 02:02:55.090
And you might think about it and reflect.

801
02:02:56.090 --> 02:03:00.090
That is convenient for Tim and Vanessa, a spread-out bed, everything is ready.

802
02:03:01.090 --> 02:03:02.090
Look at a beautiful building here.

803
02:03:03.090 --> 02:03:05.090
The church has been going for so many years.

804
02:03:06.090 --> 02:03:08.090
The structure has already been established.

805
02:03:08.090 --> 02:03:14.090
The structure of leaders and of governance, everything runs smoothly.

806
02:03:15.090 --> 02:03:17.090
But that is not how they build.

807
02:03:18.090 --> 02:03:22.090
And I find it so beautiful, because Vanessa just mentioned that as well.

808
02:03:23.090 --> 02:03:26.090
She said, we are different from Kees and Agnes.

809
02:03:27.090 --> 02:03:32.090
And that makes sense, because if you have a concrete mixer come to pour your foundation.

810
02:03:33.090 --> 02:03:36.090
That is someone else than the one who places the windows or puts the roof on.

811
02:03:37.090 --> 02:03:40.090
Or who makes a beautiful golden piece of jewelry.

812
02:03:41.090 --> 02:03:44.090
I have never seen a concrete mixer make a golden piece of jewelry.

813
02:03:45.090 --> 02:03:49.090
Those are two separate fields and both are valuable.

814
02:03:50.090 --> 02:03:51.090
Both are needed.

815
02:03:53.090 --> 02:03:59.090
So if you ever wonder why they keep talking about commitment.

816
02:03:59.090 --> 02:04:07.090
About jumping into the deep end, about more, about going further, about sanctification, about cleansing.

817
02:04:08.090 --> 02:04:11.090
Do not think that they are pushing you.

818
02:04:12.090 --> 02:04:18.090
But it is the Bible that speaks about that next phase, about building with precious stones.

819
02:04:19.090 --> 02:04:26.090
And yes, do not get me wrong, those who have just joined for the last year.

820
02:04:27.090 --> 02:04:28.090
Maybe you are still new here.

821
02:04:29.090 --> 02:04:32.090
Are you indeed still laying that foundation in your life.

822
02:04:33.090 --> 02:04:40.090
Then your life is still changing from a life without Jesus to a life with Jesus as its foundation.

823
02:04:41.090 --> 02:04:42.090
And that is perfectly fine.

824
02:04:43.090 --> 02:04:45.090
But there are also those here who have been walking for so many years.

825
02:04:46.090 --> 02:04:50.090
And it is time to simply step into the next phase of building with the church.

826
02:04:53.090 --> 02:04:56.090
They are responsible for how they build the church.

827
02:04:56.090 --> 02:04:59.090
You are responsible for how you build your life.

828
02:05:01.090 --> 02:05:05.090
And I am also glad, as they just said, because so much has already been said actually.

829
02:05:06.090 --> 02:05:08.090
That there are really nice people around you.

830
02:05:09.090 --> 02:05:14.090
Who guide you, who support you, with advice and stand by you.

831
02:05:17.090 --> 02:05:19.090
You know, everyone has their own story.

832
02:05:20.090 --> 02:05:22.090
I had already mentioned that in the app earlier this week.

833
02:05:23.090 --> 02:05:24.090
Everyone has their own story.

834
02:05:25.090 --> 02:05:26.090
Have you been here for 40 years?

835
02:05:27.090 --> 02:05:28.090
Or have you just been here for a week?

836
02:05:30.090 --> 02:05:31.090
What is your story?

837
02:05:32.090 --> 02:05:33.090
Where are you in your building process?

838
02:05:34.090 --> 02:05:36.090
Are you still laying the foundation?

839
02:05:37.090 --> 02:05:38.090
Or are you already taking steps further?

840
02:05:39.090 --> 02:05:42.090
And what has Jesus done in those 40 years in your life?

841
02:05:43.090 --> 02:05:44.090
How has your life changed?

842
02:05:46.090 --> 02:05:47.090
May I ask for the pen?

843
02:05:48.090 --> 02:05:49.090
How has your life changed?

844
02:05:50.090 --> 02:05:52.090
How has He intervened in your life?

845
02:05:55.090 --> 02:05:57.090
And that is what I want to challenge you with this afternoon.

846
02:05:58.090 --> 02:06:01.090
We still have a nice and long time ahead.

847
02:06:02.090 --> 02:06:04.090
Ask someone else you don't know.

848
02:06:05.090 --> 02:06:06.090
What is your story?

849
02:06:07.090 --> 02:06:09.090
What is your gemstone?

850
02:06:10.090 --> 02:06:11.090
Where have you built?

851
02:06:12.090 --> 02:06:14.090
You know, and let me conclude with this.

852
02:06:15.090 --> 02:06:20.090
This church is built on the cornerstone, the standard stone Jesus Christ.

853
02:06:21.090 --> 02:06:22.090
And now we continue to build.

854
02:06:22.090 --> 02:06:25.090
Sanctification, cleansing, prayer.

855
02:06:26.090 --> 02:06:28.090
Jesus builds His church.

856
02:06:29.090 --> 02:06:31.090
He is our great master builder.

857
02:06:32.090 --> 02:06:33.090
Amen.

